Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:10.69,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,You blasted human...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.69,0:00:12.86,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,You think you can meddle in my plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:16.49,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I swore I'd never let Miss Philia go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:21.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:23.57,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:26.63,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,But I'm so glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:33.76,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I made you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.18,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Presumptuous fool! You haven't beaten me yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.90,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Asmodeus... We will defeat you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:46.00,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(850,1)\blur4\t(1,710,\blur0)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\3c&HFCFEFE&}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:50.54,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,270)\shad1\bord0\fnGeorgia\fs10\c&HF9F8FA&\3c&H4E4E4E&\4c&H252526&\pos(495,283.044)}Episode 12\N "{\fs12\c&H575FE4&}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&HF9F8FA&\fs10}: Tossed Aside \Nby My Fiancé, Now in Another Kingdom"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.76,0:01:52.04,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:55.21,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Blast him! Dark Matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:08.19,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Bow before me, inferior humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:12.38,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:21.45,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,It's been four hundred years\N since I've felt such power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:27.66,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,All because that pathetic \Nman broke the seal...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.93,0:02:29.46,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Holy Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:33.97,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,This power...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:36.63,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,It's so much stronger than when\Nwe fought him on the surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:41.39,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Asmodeus is fully revived then, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:42.23,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:46.43,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,We can't let him return to the surface now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:50.99,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Big Sis, you'd better not be thinking about \Nsacrificing your life to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:56.15,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,I would gladly give my life \Nto save the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:03:00.60,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I could get Asmodeus to drop \Nhis guard for a single second...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:04.42,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Asmodeus, if you let your \Npower rage unchecked,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:06.66,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,you'll damage your Fianna doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:08.57,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,You're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:11.15,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,You're unlike Fianna in every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:14.77,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,That mercenary attitude of yours \Nis completely unlike her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:19.42,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,You may be her reincarnation, \Nbut you're nothing like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:24.05,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I no longer care what happens to your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:26.13,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Catastrophe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:31.69,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Holy Barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:34.10,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:47.45,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:50.49,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Magic's run dry, has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:56.54,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,You may be the "greatest of all time," \Nbut this proves you're still merely human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:02.05,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I can't give up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:05.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I made a promise to Prince Osvalt...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:13.00,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,At a time like this, my first thought \Nis about the promise we made?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.71,0:04:16.90,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:20.32,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,You heart lies with the \Nprince of Parnacorta, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.62,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:28.76,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I wonder how you'll react when I \Ntear him to shreds before your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:29.33,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:33.41,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,And not just the Parnacortan prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:39.09,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I'll have you watch as I beat \Neveryone you care about to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:42.65,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to protect them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:47.74,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}the people... I care about...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:52.02,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}even if it costs my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.08,Main - Italics,Fianna,0,0,0,,Philia Adenauer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:04:58.77,Main - Italics,Fianna,0,0,0,,I have heard your plea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.21,0:05:16.61,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You're the saint who saved \Nthe kingdom, Fianna Aesfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:19.04,Default,Fianna,0,0,0,,I must ask your forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:24.26,Default,Fianna,0,0,0,,Because the seal I created was imperfect, \NI've made terrible trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.79,0:05:30.09,Default,Fianna,0,0,0,,Philia Adenauer, I now \Nentrust my power to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.95,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Wh-What...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:44.05,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Fianna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:45.65,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,That's you, isn't it, Fianna?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:48.60,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Do you know how long I've waited for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:52.05,Default,Fianna,0,0,0,,Asmodeus, you are simply incorrigible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:56.46,Default,Fianna,0,0,0,,I warned you not to cause \Nany further harm to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Saint Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:07.01,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:08.72,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:14.98,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I will see to Asmodeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:16.52,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.71,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,A mere human? Don't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:21.43,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Fianna!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:24.65,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I'll liberate you from that body at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:26.86,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,He's unleashing that big spell again, Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:28.78,Default,Philia/Fianna,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:31.00,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,It won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:32.57,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Your pathetic little spells—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:43.92,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I-Impossible. You were \Nfaster at casting than I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:56.06,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I-It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:04.57,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Th-That which sealed me away \Nfour hundred years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:08.90,Default,Philia/Fianna,0,0,0,,El Nortia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:13.42,Default,Philia/Fianna,0,0,0,,You shan't revive so easily again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:16.33,Default,Philia/Fianna,0,0,0,,I'm going to smash your soul to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.33,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Fianna! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:20.71,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:23.79,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,All I want is you! \NI don't need anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:25.54,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.51,0:07:29.63,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I am not Saint Fianna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:34.75,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Perhaps it was desperation\N for love that made you do all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:37.89,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,but as a saint,\N I cannot condone your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:39.81,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:41.54,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:57.95,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Fianna, I love y—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:07.08,Main - Italics,Fianna,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving the world,\N Philia Adenauer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:11.88,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,That is simply the duty of a saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:16.78,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Miss Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:20.45,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:24.98,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I would be dead had you not\N arrived when you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:27.81,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:29.85,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Of course I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.85,0:08:33.09,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,After all, Miss Philia, I... Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.61,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:38.99,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Time to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:42.58,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,You can't say that in this gloomy old hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.95,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Pick somewhere with \Nbetter atmosphere, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:47.99,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I suppose you do have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:50.45,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,The mood is important and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:55.49,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:59.47,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Philia? What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:01.77,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It has been some time, Prince Julius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.57,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You cold-hearted woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:07.04,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's your fault \Nthat Mia betrayed me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.07,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,You simply never cease to vex me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:10.48,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,If not for you—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:12.61,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.61,0:09:13.72,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:14.82,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.39,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Perfect timing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:19.10,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Now I can use my new power to—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:22.51,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Wait, where's my new power?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:26.71,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Give it up, Girtonian princeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:28.04,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:29.25,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Get your dirty hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:33.38,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Well, I much prefer to dine on the \Ndisdain of beautiful ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:40.30,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,But I wouldn't mind munching on \Na snotty little brat for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:43.02,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Wah! Smackity splat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:46.56,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Mammon, take that loser \Nto the Girtonian prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:51.32,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Give a demon \Na break for once, Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:56.87,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Let's go back, Miss Philia...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:09:58.03,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:03.96,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnGeorgia\b1\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\pos(323,110)}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:02.85,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:07.16,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:08.96,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:10.58,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:14.58,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia, I'm sorry I worried you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:18.54,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,No... I'm just glad you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:25.02,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt, thank you \Nfor bringing my sister back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:27.40,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:10:59.94,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:06.14,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I had many chances to tell \Nyou the truth before now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:11.40,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Forgive me for keeping you \Nin the dark for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:15.06,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Teacher, please don't bow to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.06,0:11:17.07,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia told me what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:21.41,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,though I'm sure she found \Nit hard to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.99,0:11:26.74,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You taught me many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:32.04,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,To survive, not just as \Na saint, but as a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:36.63,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You're the reason that I am who I am today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:42.25,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,But I never gave you the \Nmother's love you deserved...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:43.80,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:48.72,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,More than I could ever expound upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:54.40,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,My body, my power, my life... \NThey are all precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:57.35,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,So thank you, Teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:11:59.66,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,No, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:04.54,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,It almost feels inappropriate...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:08.41,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I haven't done a single \Nmotherly thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:12.10,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,There is so much more \NI wish to learn from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:17.17,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Things I've wondered about since the day\N I learned that you were my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:20.26,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I believe you already know the broad strokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:23.59,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I don't see how else I can enlighten you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:26.93,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I want to know about my real father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:30.14,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.91,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,That's a natural curiosity, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:36.01,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Yet for some reason, I didn't expect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.01,0:12:40.07,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Perhaps, knowing you,\N I wasn't anticipating ordinary questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.07,0:12:42.14,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it that strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:43.29,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}How curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.29,0:12:46.07,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}She seems so surprised about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:50.66,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Your father was a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:53.33,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,He had incredible gift for healing wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:57.33,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,He died during an epidemic,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:13:01.36,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,but he worried over you until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:04.97,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:11.72,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps my talent for healing \Nmagic comes from my father, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:15.69,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:18.27,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,But is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:20.56,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:21.84,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:24.88,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm interested to hear where \Nand how the two of you met,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:29.90,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,how you courted, and then eventually \Ncame to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:34.58,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,You really are full of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.33,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,You almost sound like Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:38.73,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You've told Mia all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.73,0:13:42.34,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,She doesn't know the meaning of restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:44.23,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.23,0:13:46.38,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I'll give you what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:51.48,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I always intended to give \Nyou anything you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:55.81,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Do you like it, Miss Hildegarde?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:14:00.08,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Saint Philia informed us \Nof your penchant for seafood,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:13:58.94,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,320)\bord1\fnArial\b1\shad1\pos(312.845,168.993)\c&HBA4ABE&\3c&H443345&\4c&HFFFFFF&}What a feast
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:03.63,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,so I availed myself to its creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:08.86,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Leonardo, this is much too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:10.45,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:13.16,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,We know how much Saint Philia loves to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.99,0:14:16.54,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Philia? You eat this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:21.00,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Since coming to Parnacorta...\NYes, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:24.02,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Leonardo's food is just so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:28.76,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Philia, you've been blessed \Nwith fine companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:33.12,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I was worried at first when I heard \Nyou'd been sent to Parnacorta,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:36.77,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,but seeing you now makes me realize \Nthat my worries were unfounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:41.06,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm grateful to all of them every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:47.74,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:50.53,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:53.58,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're worried about Miss Mia, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:55.83,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,So if you'd like...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:58.12,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm not going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:03.00,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,This kingdom no longer needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:06.59,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,They have my teacher,\N as well as a proper saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:13.75,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Big Sis, shouldn't you go give\N Philia there a proper goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:14.39,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:17.02,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,As long as she remains \Nthe greatest of all time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:19.52,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll cross paths again eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:30.90,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,People are constantly pestering me \Nto bring Miss Philia back somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:34.00,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you could convince her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:37.91,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I have no right to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:40.21,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,It would be utterly shameless, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:42.96,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:48.46,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,We have to bring prosperity to our \Nkingdom ourselves, by hook or by crook.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:52.72,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Responsibility for the foolish decision \Nto sell Miss Philia to Parnacorta
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:55.13,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,doesn't fall on Julius alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:58.35,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,It lies with everyone who didn't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:00.67,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Prince Fernand...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:03.73,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,And I bear the greatest \Nresponsibility of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.73,0:16:08.90,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Until you inspired me, fear of my brother \Nand my own weakness kept me paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.85,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I won't make excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:15.69,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,There's no need to dwell on the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:19.47,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,You've reflected on what you've \Ndone and begun to move forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:23.12,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,guiding Girtonia in a better direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:25.92,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,We're making progress now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:28.88,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's a shame \Nto waste time on regret?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:33.67,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,You're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:35.19,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.89,0:16:38.01,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,You truly are incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:42.72,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Er, shall I take that as a compliment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:44.52,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,Of course, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:48.44,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,The things you say to me give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:50.40,Default,Fernand,0,0,0,,I feel like I can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:53.43,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Your Highness! Saint Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:55.36,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,May I have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:17:00.87,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,If you find value in the things I say, \NI will speak with you every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.33,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Prince Reichardt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:15.89,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,My recent selfish actions were \Nunbecoming of a saint of Parnacorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.89,0:17:18.09,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.51,0:17:20.97,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Don't apologize, Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:26.75,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,You wished to save your loved ones,\Nwhom you left in your homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:29.17,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I fully understand your feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:32.23,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,as well as Osvalt's in aiding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:38.16,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I would have done the same \Nthing for Elizabeth, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:44.01,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, should we find ourselves \Nin similar circumstances again,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.01,0:17:46.66,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I will still try to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:50.25,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,As saint, you are the key \Nto our kingdom's prosperity,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:52.92,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,which we must protect at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:56.77,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,My kingdom is everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:18:02.65,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Philia, please continue \Nto look after our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:03.56,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:07.56,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Not merely as saint, but as a citizen \Nof this kingdom I treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:11.82,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I intend to do everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:15.82,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnGeorgia\shad0\pos(323.18,148.093)\c&H353336&\3c&HF9F4EF&\b1}One Month Later
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.82,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:17.82,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,It's been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:21.04,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Okay, not really {\i1}that{\i0} long, \Nbut are you doing well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.12,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:24.49,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you healthy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:25.87,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You too, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:29.21,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,I'm still not used to being called that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:35.20,Default,Emily,0,0,0,,The Saint Summit that gathers \Nall the saints in one place...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:38.97,Default,Emily,0,0,0,,Who could serve as its star but I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.97,0:18:41.37,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Wh-Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.56,Main - Top,Emily,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Philia Adenauer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:45.68,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,That would be Emily Mattilas, \Nsaint of Bolmern, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:47.08,Main - Top,Emily,0,0,0,,You were so invisible I barely noticed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:48.56,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I've never met her before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.56,Main - Top,Emily,0,0,0,,Come, Amanda, Jane!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:53.97,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Of the current saints, she is likely \Nthe closest to you in terms of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.70,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Except her personality \Nis the polar opposite...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.70,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.66,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,It's been ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:05.24,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,They're going to let me stay \Nand keep studying under you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:08.62,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,I can't wait to spend lots \Nmore time with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:13.42,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Good. You work very hard, \Nso I enjoy teaching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:16.21,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,What a nice thing to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:17.71,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:20.57,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Stop clinging to her like a little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:22.44,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,She's {\i1}my{\i0} big sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:24.80,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:28.92,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,As it happens, I'm Saint Philia's\N number one student!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:33.12,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,There's absolutely nothing wrong \Nwith me treating her like an elder sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.12,0:19:36.38,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Sister! Who is this girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:39.57,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.57,0:19:45.07,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,As thanks for the hairpin you \Ngave me, I got you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.07,0:19:49.26,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,It looks perfect on you, Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:52.08,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It seems a bit extravagant...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:55.10,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Miss Mia's taste is as excellent as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:20:00.38,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm sure Prince Osvalt will be so busy \Nstaring, he won't be able to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:02.22,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Please, don't tease me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:04.84,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You don't think he'll laugh at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:07.50,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,He would never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:11.02,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,I'm certain he'll compliment your look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:13.17,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,D-Do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.41,0:20:16.48,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,You're so young, Saint Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:18.40,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,I just hope you enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:21.42,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Leonardo, this is no laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:24.28,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Do pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.81,0:20:30.20,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,It's simply so rare to see you act in \Na manner befitting your age, I was relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:33.21,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,I always take the long view, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:36.19,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,A manner befitting my age, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.17,0:20:47.25,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:50.07,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,You look splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.07,0:20:53.05,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I mean, you always look lovely...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.05,0:20:55.24,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,But I couldn't help staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:21:00.15,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:03.90,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I mean you're just beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:17.74,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.17,0:21:19.80,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:24.42,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,When you first arrived in Parnacorta, \NI made you a promise...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:28.93,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,That I'd work hard to make sure \Nyou came to love our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:33.47,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Yes, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.47,0:21:38.89,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,And since then, I've made \Nso, so many memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.60,0:21:42.44,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I've come to know so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:47.16,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,And so I do love this country now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.91,0:21:54.04,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,As saint of Parnacorta, \NI hope to continue protecting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:56.29,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:22:00.46,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I love this country and \Nthe people who live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:04.30,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,And you, Philia Adenauer...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:08.68,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.18,0:22:17.24,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,S-Sorry! I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.24,0:22:19.90,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I guess that was too sudden, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:21.12,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.88,0:22:24.79,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt... It isn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.73,0:22:29.46,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I think I may be crying from happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.04,0:22:32.16,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,At least, I believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:36.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I read in a book that happiness \Ncan stimulate the tear ducts,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:38.75,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,causing tears to flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:43.34,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone analyze\Ntheir own tears of joy like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.34,0:22:45.75,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,But that's just who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:48.59,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I love that about you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.59,0:22:52.35,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Y-You love the ways in which I'm strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:56.28,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Well, I think that's what \Nfalling in love is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.28,0:22:57.62,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.04,0:22:59.98,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I understand clearly now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.34,0:23:12.32,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,To love someone is truly a \Nwonderful feeling, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.16,0:23:29.65,Main - Italics,Narration,0,0,0,,And so, the too-perfect saint,\Ntossed aside by her fiancé
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.55,0:23:34.48,Main - Italics,Narration,0,0,0,,was now in another kingdom, \Nwhere she found happiness.
